WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.10 · Marketing & Communications
Community building and engagement

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Build a community where people connect with each other and take real roles.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Give people reasons to meet and work together.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Offer roles and recognition, and listen first.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Only open spaces you can keep safe.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“13 graduate bakers in their own group; two co-host each meet-up and help run the open morning for applicants.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create one community design and the roles people can take.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
